+## Usage reported to afterModelResponse
+
+- When a turn runs tool rounds, `afterModelResponse` is called once after the round loop exits and receives usage summing every provider call in that turn ([validated by: reports the sum of every provider call when a turn runs two tool rounds](../../src/orchestration/chatOrchestrator.acceptance.test.ts#L11)).
