+- When a provider omits usage on some rounds, the rounds that reported are still summed without producing `undefined` or `NaN`, and a turn where no round reports usage passes `undefined` ([validated by: counts every reporting round when some rounds omit usage, and passes undefined when none report](../../src/orchestration/chatOrchestrator.acceptance.test.ts#L30)).
